  abstract={Mostly, many students did not get the proper academic path at first place. Therefore, they did not get a job as they like. This problem affects to decrease the talented workers in many nations. To solve this problem, we create the personality test online platform for providing guidance to students. It can provide many personality test forms, display result and career recommendation to whom taking it. Moreover, this system can create many assessments by using the specific set of expression. In conclusion, our system can help students to find their proper career by merging the result from many personality tests to get more accurate results than many methods before.},
